  "answer": "Use the refunds and payments policy, as directed by the returns policy: an approved refund is sent within 2 business days, then usually appears on the customer’s card within 5–10 business days, depending on their bank. The FAQ conflicts with this, saying refunds reach the card within 3 business days after the return is received. Both documents are in force on October 9, 2026.",
